WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.769
Whether it's on immigration
or tax returns

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:06.106
the president once again
reminded us this weekend

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:08.074
that he considers himself
above the law.

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:10.376
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:15.514
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:15.514 --> 00:00:18.218
President Trump toured the
border of Friday to once again

00:00:18.218 --> 00:00:20.553
make the case that there is
a national emergency

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.388
happening there,
which there is not.

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:24.490
He touted a section
of the border wall

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:27.226
that had been planned during the
Obama administration

00:00:27.226 --> 00:00:29.495
and in the process he invented a
new word.

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:30.830
-So behind us is the wall

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.199
That's the new wall.
we've done a lot of it.

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:35.234
And we're doing a lot more.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:36.603
You see it over here.

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:38.738
Much of it's reinforced heavily.

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.740
And very, very hard to climb.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:44.510
If you want to climb that,
pretty sharp up on top, too.

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:46.779
But it's a very, very hard
it's meant anti-climb.

00:00:46.779 --> 00:00:48.515
It's called anti-climb.

00:00:48.515 --> 00:00:51.217
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.954
So, Trump went from being the
anti-crime candidate

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.023
to the anti-climb president.

00:00:57.023 --> 00:01:00.560
He's an old man yelling at kids
to stay away from his oak tree.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:01.828
"Don't climb that!

00:01:01.828 --> 00:01:04.931
If you break your neck I ain't
gonna pay for it."

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:07.867
Trump also hosted a roundtable
event with border officials

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:10.903
and both at that event
and later at his tour of the
wall

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:13.039
he kept harping on
how good they looked.

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:14.640
-I want to thank
my men and women,

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.342
who do a tremendous job here
every day,

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:18.110
I'm very, very proud
of their commitment

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:20.112
even though they're facing
extreme challenges,

00:01:20.112 --> 00:01:21.948
as you've heard.
-They're central casting.

00:01:21.948 --> 00:01:24.050
I've never seen a group
of people like this.

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:28.922
Everyone is in perfect shape.

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.891
Central casting.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.660
You don't have anybody
in Hollywood

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:34.960
that looks like these guys.

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:41.033
-I'm pretty sure --
I'm pretty sure they do.

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:42.635
At least in one of the suburbs.

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:46.639
I feel like maybe Pomona
or something.

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:49.675
Also, Trump is very obsessed
with central casting for a guy

00:01:49.675 --> 00:01:52.511
who looks like the exact
opposite of a movie president.

00:01:52.511 --> 00:01:54.948
If Trump went to
central casting,

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:57.817
they'd probably send him on
auditions for

00:01:57.817 --> 00:02:01.821
"alcoholic Irish priest" or
"ghost who haunts a Queens OTB".

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:02.989
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:07.694
The fifth horse in the sixth
race, bet it all.

00:02:07.694 --> 00:02:09.996
Trump has been furious at Mexico
for supposedly

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:12.265
allowing migrants fleeing
poverty and violence

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:14.100
to come to the U.S.
seeking asylum.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.101
Last week, for example,
he threatened to

00:02:16.101 --> 00:02:18.371
close the border completely,
and when everyone,

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:20.873
including his own party,
warned that that would cause

00:02:20.873 --> 00:02:23.409
an economic catastrophe,
Trump backed off and claimed

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:25.344
he was giving Mexico
a one-year warning

00:02:25.344 --> 00:02:27.747
before he would impose tariffs
on Mexican imports.

00:02:27.747 --> 00:02:30.416
-The only thing frankly better
but less drastic

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:33.419
than closing the border is
tariff the cars coming in,

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:35.521
and I will do it.
Just like him --

00:02:35.521 --> 00:02:37.723
You know will do it.
I don't play games.

00:02:37.723 --> 00:02:41.127
I'll do it. So we're doing it to
stop people.

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:44.330
We gonna give them
a one-year warning.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.966
-Well, he's been promising to
build a wall for two years,

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:49.002
so if I were Mexico,
I wouldn't be that worried.

00:02:49.002 --> 00:02:50.135
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.135 --> 00:02:52.772
A one-year warning
is such a lame threat.

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:55.708
He's like a high school bully
with no follow-through.

00:02:55.708 --> 00:02:57.609
You better give me
your milk money, nerd,

00:02:57.609 --> 00:02:59.946
or I'll beat you up as soon as
the McRib comes back.

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:01.714
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:03.448
Trump has been
especially furious

00:03:03.448 --> 00:03:04.684
about the asylum process.

00:03:04.684 --> 00:03:06.485
Now it's both U.S.
and international right

00:03:06.485 --> 00:03:08.187
to seek asylum.
But Trump doesn't care.

00:03:08.187 --> 00:03:10.789
He has repeatedly painted
poor migrant families

00:03:10.789 --> 00:03:13.759
seeking asylum as dangerous
threats and he did so again

00:03:13.759 --> 00:03:15.928
in a rambling speech
over the weekend.

00:03:15.928 --> 00:03:21.934
-The asylum program is a scam.

00:03:21.934 --> 00:03:25.138
Some of the roughest people
you've ever seen,

00:03:25.138 --> 00:03:29.042
people that look like they
should be fighting for the UFC.

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:31.110
-What?

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.912
Have you ever seen a UFC fight?

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:36.382
If Connor McGregor were trying
to sneak across the border,

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:37.683
people would notice.

00:03:37.683 --> 00:03:40.753
Uh, chief,
we got a crazy Irish guy here,

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:43.756
trying to kick his way
through the wall.

00:03:43.756 --> 00:03:47.226
-[ Irish accent ] Ah, can't
climb it, but I'll kick it!

00:03:47.226 --> 00:03:51.931
This is anti-kick?
[ Laughter ]

00:03:51.931 --> 00:03:54.700
Ah.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:57.937
Trump doesn't care that we have
and established legal process

00:03:57.937 --> 00:04:00.206
in this country
for applying for asylum.

00:04:00.206 --> 00:04:02.975
That system involves making your
case in front of a judge.

00:04:02.975 --> 00:04:05.711
It's a basic right enshrined in
U.S. and international law.

00:04:05.711 --> 00:04:08.347
But Trump has been saying he
wants to get rid of that.

00:04:08.347 --> 00:04:10.883
-We have to do something about
asylum.

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:13.152
And to be honest with you, have
to get rid of judges.

00:04:13.152 --> 00:04:14.787
We have
a stupid system of ports,

00:04:14.787 --> 00:04:16.589
it's the craziest thing
in the world.

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:19.291
They have to get rid of the
whole asylum system

00:04:19.291 --> 00:04:20.693
because it doesn't work.

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:23.796
And frankly,
we should get rid of judges.

00:04:23.796 --> 00:04:25.698
-Why do you want to get
rid of judges?

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:27.332
Is it because
they keep putting

00:04:27.332 --> 00:04:29.101
everyone who works for you
in jail?

00:04:29.101 --> 00:04:36.742
[ Laughter, cheers,
and applause ]

00:04:36.742 --> 00:04:40.712
If we are going to keep judges,
they should have to pay for

00:04:40.712 --> 00:04:44.283
our monster.com account
because we're getting killed

00:04:44.283 --> 00:04:45.618
on staffing costs.

00:04:45.618 --> 00:04:47.152
Maybe Trump wants to
get rid of judges

00:04:47.152 --> 00:04:48.754
because he doesn't understand
what judges are

00:04:48.754 --> 00:04:49.888
or how court cases work.

00:04:49.888 --> 00:04:51.991
At the roundtable on Friday,
for example,

00:04:51.991 --> 00:04:54.293
he blasted a court case
called "Reno V. Flores,

00:04:54.293 --> 00:04:57.196
which protects migrant children
from being held indefinitely

00:04:57.196 --> 00:04:59.565
in custody and grants them
certain basic rights

00:04:59.565 --> 00:05:01.867
it's often referred to as
the Flores Decision.

00:05:01.867 --> 00:05:04.103
Court cases are named after
parties involved

00:05:04.103 --> 00:05:06.505
but Trump seems to think
that the case was named

00:05:06.505 --> 00:05:08.474
after the judge who made
the decision.

00:05:08.474 --> 00:05:10.877
-The Flores Decision is a
disaster.

00:05:10.877 --> 00:05:14.413
I have to tell you Judge Flores,
whoever you may be,

00:05:14.413 --> 00:05:17.316
that decision a disaster
for our country.

00:05:17.316 --> 00:05:20.253
-There is no Judge Flores.

00:05:20.253 --> 00:05:25.090
No one calls the O.J. Simpson
trial the "Lance Ito Case."

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:26.325
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:05:26.325 --> 00:05:32.732
In fact,
Trump has been so furious

00:05:32.732 --> 00:05:35.067
at his own administration's
inability to stop

00:05:35.067 --> 00:05:36.969
legal asylum seekers
that on Sunday

00:05:36.969 --> 00:05:39.238
he took the step of ousting
his own hardline

00:05:39.238 --> 00:05:41.707
Secretary of Homeland security,
Kirstjen Nielsen

00:05:41.707 --> 00:05:43.909
for not being tough enough
on immigration.

00:05:43.909 --> 00:05:45.611
And her firing
leaves yet another

00:05:45.611 --> 00:05:47.079
senior government position
filled by

00:05:47.079 --> 00:05:48.514
a temporary official.

00:05:48.514 --> 00:05:52.117
-After months of rumors and
speculation, Kirstjen Nielsen

00:05:52.117 --> 00:05:55.421
is officially out as
Secretary of Homeland Security.

00:05:55.421 --> 00:05:58.691
-She apparently bore the brunt
of the president's anger

00:05:58.691 --> 00:06:00.459
over the issue of immigration.

00:06:00.459 --> 00:06:03.763
-Now we will have an acting
Homeland Security Secretary

00:06:03.763 --> 00:06:06.332
on top of an acting
Secretary of Defense,

00:06:06.332 --> 00:06:08.935
on top of an acting
Secretary of Interior,

00:06:08.935 --> 00:06:12.071
on top of an acting
Ambassador to the United Nations

00:06:12.071 --> 00:06:14.072
and then an acting
Chief of Staff.

00:06:14.072 --> 00:06:17.276
-I mean this administration has
more staff turnover

00:06:17.276 --> 00:06:19.211
than a Walmart on Black Friday.

00:06:19.211 --> 00:06:20.612
I don't know what to tell you.

00:06:20.612 --> 00:06:24.283
we're out of Hatchimals. You
know what? I quit. Good-bye.

00:06:24.283 --> 00:06:26.085
Nielsen, of course,
oversaw and defended

00:06:26.085 --> 00:06:27.820
the administration's horrific
policy of

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:29.588
separating migrant families
and she was

00:06:29.588 --> 00:06:31.923
an enthusiastic advocate
for the Trump administration's

00:06:31.923 --> 00:06:33.058
immigration policies.

00:06:33.058 --> 00:06:34.860
At one point,
she even started mimicking

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:36.729
Trump's language
when she went to Congress

00:06:36.729 --> 00:06:38.531
and asked for more
border wall funding.

00:06:38.531 --> 00:06:41.801
-I will continue to work with
The Northern triangle countries,

00:06:41.801 --> 00:06:44.169
with Mexico,
to help vulnerable populations

00:06:44.169 --> 00:06:45.337
as soon as possible.

00:06:45.337 --> 00:06:47.339
from Congress I would ask
for wall.

00:06:47.339 --> 00:06:48.507
We need wall.

00:06:48.507 --> 00:06:50.776
-We need wall.

00:06:50.776 --> 00:06:53.412
I guess it's not surprising
they're ignoring articles

00:06:53.412 --> 00:06:56.249
of the constitution, they're
ignoring articles altogether.

00:06:56.249 --> 00:06:57.750
[ Laughter ]

00:06:57.750 --> 00:07:00.018
Trump turns everyone --

00:07:00.018 --> 00:07:04.590
Trump turns everyone
he works with into Tarzan.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:06.491
It doesn't matter how smart
you are.

00:07:06.491 --> 00:07:08.961
If Shakespeare had worked for
Trump, the line would have been

00:07:08.961 --> 00:07:12.464
"Be or not be.
That is question."

00:07:12.464 --> 00:07:13.833
The problem here
is pretty straightforward --

00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:15.801
Trump thinks he should be able
to just ignore the law.

00:07:15.801 --> 00:07:17.536
We've seen the same thing
play out this week

00:07:17.536 --> 00:07:18.704
over his tax returns.

00:07:18.704 --> 00:07:20.706
For months,
Trump has been building toward

00:07:20.706 --> 00:07:22.708
a confrontation
with Democrats in Congress

00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:23.809
over those tax returns.

00:07:23.809 --> 00:07:25.277
Trump has promised
for years

00:07:25.277 --> 00:07:27.145
that he would
eventually release them,

00:07:27.145 --> 00:07:29.615
but he has repeatedly used
an obviously false excuse,

00:07:29.615 --> 00:07:30.949
that he's always under audit.

00:07:30.949 --> 00:07:32.918
It's an excuse
he started using in 2016

00:07:32.918 --> 00:07:35.521
that has continued to repeat as
recently as last week.

00:07:35.521 --> 00:07:37.656
-Are you going to release your
tax returns?

00:07:37.656 --> 00:07:39.926
-At the appropriate time
I will release them,

00:07:39.926 --> 00:07:41.994
but right now I'm under a
routine audit.

00:07:41.994 --> 00:07:44.463
I don't mind releasing,
I'm under a routine audit,

00:07:44.463 --> 00:07:47.033
an it'll be released and as soon
as the audit's finished,

00:07:47.033 --> 00:07:48.166
it'll be released.

00:07:48.166 --> 00:07:51.303
Look, as I told you,
they're under audit.

00:07:51.303 --> 00:07:55.575
They're extremely complex.
People wouldn't understand them.

00:07:55.575 --> 00:07:58.844
Every year they audit me,
audit me, audit me.

00:07:58.844 --> 00:08:00.212
Nobody gets audi--
I have friends

00:08:00.212 --> 00:08:02.047
that are very wealthy people,
they never get audited.

00:08:02.047 --> 00:08:03.715
I've been audited every year.

00:08:03.715 --> 00:08:05.852
I'm always under audit,
it seems.

00:08:05.852 --> 00:08:08.153
I've been under audit
for many years

00:08:08.153 --> 00:08:11.690
because the numbers are big and
I guess when you have a name,

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:13.959
you're audited.

00:08:13.959 --> 00:08:16.695
-First of all
it's not when you have a name.

00:08:16.695 --> 00:08:18.163
It's when you have your name.

00:08:18.163 --> 00:08:20.399
If you had four bankruptcies
ties to mobsters

00:08:20.399 --> 00:08:22.668
and lied about your net worth
your whole life,

00:08:22.668 --> 00:08:24.035
you're going to get audited.

00:08:24.035 --> 00:08:27.072
That's the easiest call
an IRS agent will ever make.

00:08:27.072 --> 00:08:28.173
Who should we audit?

00:08:28.173 --> 00:08:30.176
I don't know,
how about the guy

00:08:30.176 --> 00:08:33.078
whose penthouse looks like
Goldmember's bathroom?

00:08:33.078 --> 00:08:35.347
Second, this audit
is obviously not real.

00:08:35.347 --> 00:08:37.783
It wasn't real
when he first said it in 2016

00:08:37.783 --> 00:08:40.385
and there's no way it's taken
almost four years.

00:08:40.385 --> 00:08:42.855
It can't be that hard
to find something fishy

00:08:42.855 --> 00:08:44.123
in Trump's tax returns.

00:08:44.123 --> 00:08:46.658
Just skim down to
the charity line

00:08:46.658 --> 00:08:48.794
where he listed his adult sons.

00:08:48.794 --> 00:08:50.729
Trump is the first President
in 40 years

00:08:50.729 --> 00:08:52.164
not to release his tax returns.

00:08:52.164 --> 00:08:53.465
And without them,
we have no idea

00:08:53.465 --> 00:08:55.268
where he's getting money from
or who he owes money to.

00:08:55.268 --> 00:08:56.769
Which is crazy.
He's the president.

00:08:56.769 --> 00:08:59.004
You'd want to know
if your doctor

00:08:59.004 --> 00:09:01.540
had a side business
running a mortuary.

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:05.444
Your test results were negative
but just in case,

00:09:05.444 --> 00:09:08.914
have you thought about
a wood casket? Pine?

00:09:08.914 --> 00:09:10.849
After Democrats won back
the house in November,

00:09:10.849 --> 00:09:12.485
giving them subpoena power,
Trump warned

00:09:12.485 --> 00:09:14.787
that he would resist attempts
to subpoena his tax returns.

00:09:14.787 --> 00:09:17.789
And one point even said
he was bored by the question.

00:09:17.789 --> 00:09:20.192
-Just a point of clarification
the tax returns issue,

00:09:20.192 --> 00:09:22.394
you bought up the audit,
that doesn't prevent you

00:09:22.394 --> 00:09:23.796
from releasing them.
-I know.

00:09:23.796 --> 00:09:25.798
Sure but I didn't say it
prevented me

00:09:25.798 --> 00:09:28.167
but I said lawyers will tell you
not to do it.

00:09:28.167 --> 00:09:30.035
Go ahead.
What's your next question?

00:09:30.035 --> 00:09:31.470
-Well, it,s just --
-Come on. Let's go.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:32.971
More exciting question than
that, please.

00:09:32.971 --> 00:09:37.910
-Oh, I'm sorry, are we
boring you, Caligula?

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.346
It's not their job
to entertain you.

00:09:40.346 --> 00:09:42.648
Who'd win a fight,
a tiger or an alligator?

00:09:42.648 --> 00:09:44.417
Now there we go,
that's a fun question.

00:09:44.417 --> 00:09:45.851
[ Laughter ]

00:09:45.851 --> 00:09:48.153
This is the White House,
not the Roman Coliseum.

00:09:48.153 --> 00:09:49.655
They're not gonna
feed you grapes

00:09:49.655 --> 00:09:50.823
while you watch them joust.

00:09:50.823 --> 00:09:53.559
Kellyanne,
make the reporters fight.

00:09:53.559 --> 00:09:56.395
[ Laughter ]

00:09:56.395 --> 00:09:58.263
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:58.263 --> 00:10:02.367
At that same press conference,
Trump also threatened

00:10:02.367 --> 00:10:06.572
that there would be consequences
if Democrats subpoena

00:10:06.572 --> 00:10:07.973
his tax returns.

00:10:07.973 --> 00:10:09.975
-Do you expect that when the
Democrats take over

00:10:09.975 --> 00:10:12.043
the chairmanship of all these
important committees

00:10:12.043 --> 00:10:14.146
you're going to get hit
with a blizzard of subpoenas

00:10:14.146 --> 00:10:15.714
on everything from
the Russia investigation --

00:10:15.714 --> 00:10:16.915
-Well then it's going to come --
okay.

00:10:16.915 --> 00:10:18.417
-To your cellphone use,
to your tax returns.

00:10:18.417 --> 00:10:19.484
-Ready?

00:10:19.484 --> 00:10:21.654
Then, you're going to,
if that happens,

00:10:21.654 --> 00:10:23.755
then we're going to do
the same thing

00:10:23.755 --> 00:10:25.757
and the government
comes to a halt.

00:10:25.757 --> 00:10:26.826
-Comes to a halt?

00:10:26.826 --> 00:10:28.660
The government
is already at a halt.

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:30.762
Forget the tax returns,
you shut the government down

00:10:30.762 --> 00:10:32.765
for a month because you
didn't get your dumb wall.

00:10:32.765 --> 00:10:34.466
Plus there's like
four people working there

00:10:34.466 --> 00:10:35.968
and half the time
you're in Florida.

00:10:35.968 --> 00:10:40.806
There are empty Blockbuster
video stores with more activity.

00:10:40.806 --> 00:10:43.175
Honey, I --

00:10:43.175 --> 00:10:47.579
Great news honey, I just rented
a VHS copy of "Forrest Gump"

00:10:47.579 --> 00:10:49.815
from a very friendly squirrel.

00:10:49.815 --> 00:10:51.550
That threat is telling
because Trump isn't

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:52.951
actually making
a legal argument,

00:10:52.951 --> 00:10:54.453
he's simply saying
he doesn't care.

00:10:54.453 --> 00:10:55.621
If you try to
hold him accountable,

00:10:55.621 --> 00:10:57.289
he'll shut down the government.
That's it.

00:10:57.289 --> 00:10:59.592
And this weekend, after
Democrats officially requested

00:10:59.592 --> 00:11:01.594
six years of Trump's tax
returns from the IRS,

00:11:01.594 --> 00:11:03.161
his Chief of Staff --
oh, excuse me,

00:11:03.161 --> 00:11:05.430
his acting Chief of Staff,
Mick Mulvaney,

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:06.799
made a similar argument.

00:11:06.799 --> 00:11:09.101
Mulvaney, said flat out
the Democrats would never get

00:11:09.101 --> 00:11:11.237
Trump's tax returns no matter
what the law says.

00:11:11.237 --> 00:11:13.639
-You believe Democrats
will never see

00:11:13.639 --> 00:11:15.340
the president's tax returns?

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:16.609
-Oh, no. Never.

00:11:16.609 --> 00:11:17.976
N-Nor should they.

00:11:17.976 --> 00:11:20.346
-What do you mean never?
It's a congressional request.

00:11:20.346 --> 00:11:22.881
You can't just turn it down like
hors d'oeuvres at a party.

00:11:22.881 --> 00:11:24.082
you've been served.

00:11:24.082 --> 00:11:29.454
Oh, no thank you I've already
had 100 Big Macs.

00:11:29.454 --> 00:11:31.523
Whenever Trump
is threatened politically,

00:11:31.523 --> 00:11:34.026
he becomes more lawless,
whether it's on immigration

00:11:34.026 --> 00:11:36.461
or tax returns, he sees himself
as above that law.

00:11:36.461 --> 00:11:38.296
He's painting immigrants
as criminals,

00:11:38.296 --> 00:11:40.332
while he refuses to show us
his tax returns.

00:11:40.332 --> 00:11:41.734
You could almost say the whole
thing is --

00:11:41.734 --> 00:11:44.837
-A scam.
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:44.837 --> 00:11:47.440
[ Cheers and applause ]

